# Wulfgar of Icewind Dale: "If a creature you control attacking causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to
# trigger" (CR 603.2d) - the attacking creature must be its controller's. Bot1 has two Curses of Predation ("Whenever a
# creature attacks enchanted player, put a +1/+1 counter on it"), one on Bot2 (turn 3) and one on itself (turn 5).
# Wulfgar attacking Bot2 on turn 3 triggers the first Curse twice (two counters) and melee twice: 4/4 + 2 + 2 = 8, Bot2 at
# 12. On turn 6 Bot2's Elvish Mystic attacking Bot1 triggers the second Curse, a permanent Bot1 controls, but no creature
# Bot1 controls attacked: once, one counter, a 2/2 that deals 2.

